(text "POWER\nUSB-C 5 V (sink, 5.1k on CC). Polyfuse 500 mA.\nLM27762: low-noise +/-4.0 V for the op-amps (VOUT+ = 1.2 V*(1+R1/R2), VOUT- = -1.22 V*(1+R3/R4)).\nLP5907-3.3: +3V3A for Si5351, CS5343, PCA9555, level shifters.\nFerrite-isolated +5V_DDS (AD9851) and +5V_A (SA612 mixers)." (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6e4737a9-86b0-41f8-97fd-c7b83fd2e402))
